gantt
    title Taskuri device (0–10 s)
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss.SSS
    axisFormat %S s
    tickInterval 1second
    todayMarker off

    section Periodic (T=2 s)
    Job 0 :active, 1970-01-01 00:00:00.000, 200ms
    Job 1 :active, 1970-01-01 00:00:02.000, 200ms
    Job 2 :active, 1970-01-01 00:00:04.000, 200ms
    Job 3 :active, 1970-01-01 00:00:06.000, 200ms
    Job 4 :active, 1970-01-01 00:00:08.000, 200ms

    section Sporadic (minimum 5 s)
    Alarm accepted :milestone, 1970-01-01 00:00:02.000, 0s
    Alarm rejected (only 2 s later) :crit, milestone, 1970-01-01 00:00:04.000, 0s

    section Aperiodic
    STATUS command :active, 1970-01-01 00:00:05.500, 200ms

    section Window
    End (10 s) :milestone, 1970-01-01 00:00:10.000, 0s
